RPHP timezone data snapshot
===========================

Source: https://data.iana.org/time-zones/releases/tzdata2026a.tar.gz
Release: 2026a
Archive SHA-256: 77b541725937bb53bd92bd484c0b43bec8545e2d3431ee01f04ef8f2203ba2b7

The files in this directory are unmodified data files from the IANA Time Zone
Database data-only distribution.  The accompanying LICENSE states that these
files are in the public domain unless specified otherwise.

RPHP does not use IANA's tzcode implementation.  The repository-owned Rust
generator in scripts/generate-tzdb.rs parses these source tables and produces
the compact transition database consumed by RPHP's independently implemented
Date engine.

Regeneration from the repository root:

    rustc --edition=2024 scripts/generate-tzdb.rs -o /tmp/rphp-generate-tzdb
    /tmp/rphp-generate-tzdb data/tzdata/2026a \
        data/tzdata/2026a/rphp-tzdb.bin

Generated database SHA-256:
6c81fdaf16ad0762b32452b39296aaa016a9842e6ac9c60da4d3f7dce438293c
